# LeakSanitizer suppressions for cicd.bash's Sanitizers step. Prebuilt
# libraries only, matched by library name, such as leak:libQt6Gui.so for Qt.
# A leak in our code, or in a crate built from source, gets fixed instead.
# A leak: line matches any frame in the stack, not just the one that
# allocated, so a planted leak has to be caught with this file loaded.
# None are needed so far.
